 otag setup │ step 9 of 9: Review
╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Review                                                                       │
│                                                                              │
│ Files:                                                                       │
│   create  ~/.config/otag/registry.toml                                       │
│   create  ~/.config/otag/projects/myapp.toml                                 │
│ Then:                                                                        │
│   otag sync             load the config into the database                    │
│   otag daemon install   start the background service                         │
│ Project myapp (prefix mya, worktree, guard light):                           │
│   coordinator claude-opus · default claude-sonnet · review codex             │
│ Profiles:                                                                    │
│   claude-opus    opus, high  → codex, opencode, claude-sonnet                │
│   claude-sonnet  sonnet  → codex-medium, opencode, claude-haiku              │
│   claude-haiku   haiku  → codex-medium, opencode                             │
│   codex          default model, high  → claude-opus, opencode, codex-medium  │
│   codex-medium   default model, medium  → claude-sonnet, opencode            │
│   opencode       default model  → claude-sonnet, codex-medium                │
│                                                                              │
